{
  "id": "hr-lesson-gender",
  "lang": "hr",
  "courseId": "hr-course-a1",
  "unitId": "hr-unit-1",
  "order": 2,
  "title": "Noun Gender & Plurals",
  "prerequisiteIds": ["hr-lesson-greetings"],
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "explanation", "markdown": "Croatian has **no articles at all** — no \"the\" or \"a\". Instead, every noun has one of three genders, usually predictable from its ending: a noun ending in a **consonant** is masculine (**grad**, city), ending in **-a** is feminine (**kuća**, house), and ending in **-o** or **-e** is neuter (**more**, sea)." },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "hr-ex-gender-1" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "hr-ex-gender-2" },
    { "type": "explanation", "markdown": "Plurals follow the gender: masculine nouns usually add **-i** (**prijatelj → prijatelji**), feminine nouns ending in **-a** change it to **-e** (**kuća → kuće**), and neuter nouns ending in **-o/-e** change to **-a** (**more → mora**)." },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "hr-ex-gender-3" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "hr-ex-gender-4" }
  ],
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "hr-ex-gender-1",
      "type": "multiple-choice",
      "prompt": "What gender is \"grad\" (city — ends in a consonant)?",
      "answer": "masculine",
      "distractors": ["feminine", "neuter"],
      "relatedItemId": "hr-vocab-travel-010"
    },
    {
      "id": "hr-ex-gender-2",
      "type": "multiple-choice",
      "prompt": "What gender is \"kuća\" (house — ends in -a)?",
      "answer": "feminine",
      "distractors": ["masculine", "neuter"],
      "relatedItemId": "hr-vocab-routine-028"
    },
    {
      "id": "hr-ex-gender-3",
      "type": "multiple-choice",
      "prompt": "What gender is \"more\" (sea — ends in -e)?",
      "answer": "neuter",
      "distractors": ["masculine", "feminine"],
      "relatedItemId": "hr-vocab-travel-030"
    },
    {
      "id": "hr-ex-gender-4",
      "type": "fill-blank",
      "prompt": "What is the plural of \"prijatelj\" (friend)?",
      "answer": "prijatelji",
      "relatedItemId": "hr-vocab-greet-024"
    }
  ]
}
